{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Space Explorer Academy 是一款為好奇小朋友而設的太空探索應用，讓孩子透過探索、遊戲與收集，輕鬆認識太陽系，全程沒有廣告。它專為 6 至 8 歲、喜愛行星與太空人的孩子設計，現由原價 US $0.99 限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>互動探索太陽系與行星檔案</h2>\n<p>孩子可在互動太陽系中縮放與平移，探索 8 顆行星、5 顆矮行星及 8 顆衛星，並隨進度解鎖各世界。行星檔案備有知識與圖庫，另收錄 34 個恆星、星系、星雲與深空天體，可開啟旁白聆聽。遊戲設有月球任務、火星探索任務與太空人學院 6 堂課，配合問答、XP、連續紀錄及 10 個徽章。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-276-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-277-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-278-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-279-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-280-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-281-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Space Explorer Academy</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T07:17:30.082401+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":343,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}